      "British Society for Haematology (BSH) — Guidelines for the diagnosis and management of adult aplastic anaemia",
      "Kidney Disease: Improving Global Outcomes (KDIGO) — Clinical Practice Guideline for Anemia in Chronic Kidney Disease",
      "AABB — Red Blood Cell Transfusion: 2023 AABB International Guidelines",
      "Thalassaemia International Federation (TIF) — Guidelines for the Management of Transfusion Dependent Thalassaemia",
