      "Cheson BD, et al. — Lugano Classification: Recommendations for Initial Evaluation, Staging, and Response Assessment of Hodgkin and Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma (Journal of Clinical Oncology, 2014)",
      "WHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Haematolymphoid Tumours, 5th ed., vol. 11. IARC, 2024.",
